st/security#密码和密钥","content":"国密 `sm-suite` 模式下必须随配置和备份一起保存"},"981":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-30","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#密码和密钥","content":"SSO Client Secret"},"982":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-31","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#密码和密钥","content":"不写入公开仓库，不在截图中暴露"},"983":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-32","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#国密支持","content":"Crest 支持国密 `sm-suite` 模式。启用后，登录传输使用 SM2，密码使用 SM3 迭代哈希，敏感配置使用带随机 IV 和 HMAC-SM3 完整性校验的 SM4 密文保存，下载票据等签名链路使用 HMAC-SM3。"},"984":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-33","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#国密支持","content":"国密模式属于部署与安全配置，不改变业务页面的使用方式。用户创建数据源、数据集、图表、仪表盘、数据大屏、分享和导出的流程保持一致；管理员仍按相同入口管理用户、角色、权限、SSO 和审计日志。"},"985":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-34","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#国密支持","content":"启用 `CREST_CRYPTO_MODE=sm-suite` 后，`CREST_SM4_KEY` 必须长期保存。升级、迁移、恢复或扩容时更换 SM4 Key，可能导致已保存的敏感配置无法解密。"},"986":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-35","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#数据源账号","content":"数据源建议使用最小权限账号："},"987":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-36","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#数据源账号","content":"分析场景优先使用只读账号。"},"988":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#数据源账号","content":"不给分析账号授予建库、删库、授权等高危权限。"},"989":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-38","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#数据源账号","content":"生产库和测试库使用不同账号。"},"990":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#数据源账号","content":"定期轮换数据源密码，并在 Crest 中同步更新。"},"991":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"权限由菜单权限、功能权限、资源权限和数据集行列权限共同组成。"},"992":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"权限层级"},"993":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"控制内容"},"994":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"菜单权限"},"995":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"能否进入某个功能页面"},"996":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"功能权限"},"997":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"能否执行新建、编辑、复制、删除、导出等操作"},"998":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"资源权限"},"999":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"能否访问某个数据源、数据集、仪表盘或大屏"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"数据权限"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"能否查看某些行或列"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"权限配置完成后，应使用普通账号复核，避免仅从管理员视角判断权限结果。"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/crest/security-52","page_id":"/docs/crest/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/security#权限控制","content":"v1.5.6 起，数据大屏和仪表盘资源树会按权限区分只读可见资源和可管理资源。只读用户不应看到复制、移动、重命名和删除入口；资源管理者