2992":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#最常用的开发流程","content":"如团队已提供 `v1.5.10` 开发库 dump，建议按以下流程搭建："},"2993":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#拉代码","content":"克隆 Crest，切到 `v1.5.10`，再从 tag 建自己的开发分支。"},"2994":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#导入元数据库","content":"新建本地 `crest` 库，把团队提供的 `v1.5.10` dump 导进去。"},"2995":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#写本地环境变量","content":"新建 `.local/crest-dev-env.sh`。数据库地址、账号、密码、加密密钥、文件目录都写在这里，不改仓库里的 `application*.yml`。"},"2996":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#关闭本地不需要的功能","content":"导入完整 dump 后关闭 Flyway；本地不调 SSO 时关闭 SSO；业务数据源连不到时改成内网可访问地址。"},"2997":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#启动服务","content":"后端启动 `io.crest.CoreApplication`，前端启动 `pnpm dev`。本地默认访问 `http://localhost:8080`。"},"2998":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#启动服务","content":"没有 dump 时，可以使用空库初始化。该方式由 Flyway 创建基础表结构，页面中只包含初始化数据和可选演示资源。"},"2999":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#1-准备工具","content":"工具"},"3000":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/de