":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"查看缓存同步时间和同步状态。"},"3363":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-114","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"查看源数据行数、缓存行数和一致性校验结果。"},"3364":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-115","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"手动触发一次同步或等待定时任务执行。"},"3365":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-116","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"回到图表、仪表盘或数据大屏刷新页面。"},"3366":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-117","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"如果仍是旧数据，再检查 SQL、过滤条件、增量字段和数据权限。"},"3367":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-118","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"缓存适合提升查询性能，但需要和业务方说明刷新周期。实时监控类页面不建议使用过长缓存周期。"},"3368":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-119","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"常见状态处理："},"3369":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-120","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"状态"},"3370":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-121","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"处理"},"3371":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-122","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"源数据与缓存一致"},"3372":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-123","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"说明当前缓存结果可作为页面数据来源，仍需确认业务刷新时间"},"3373":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-124","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"数据一致性校验失败"},"3374":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-125","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"检查同步日志、增量字段、水位和源库是否仍在写入"},"3375":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-126","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"缓存同步失败"},"3376":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-127","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"先测试数据源连接，再检查 SQL、权限和任务超时"},"3377":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-128","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"看不到缓存入口"},"3378":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-129","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"确认数据源是否为 MySQL，环境是否已升级到当前文档版本"},"3379":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","type":"page","content":"问题索引","breadcrumbs":["技术文档","Crest","常见问题"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq"},"3380":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-0","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq","content":"Crest 安装登录、权限、数据可视化、单点登录和 Kubernetes 常见问题索引。"},"3381":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-1","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"问题分类"},"3382":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-2","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq#排查基本顺序","content":"排查基本顺序"},"3383":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-3","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"提交问题时建议提供"},"3384":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-4","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq#常用截图","content":"常用截图"},"3385":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-5","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq","content":"本页汇总 Crest 使用和运维中的高频问题。建议先按问题类型进入对应章节，再按“现象 → 可能原因 → 处理顺序”排查。"},"3386":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-6","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq","content":"排查问题时，不建议直接修改配置。应先复现问题、保留截图、记录发生时间，再查看审计日志、应用日志和浏览器提示。部分问题表现为“页面打不开”或“图表没数据”，实际原因可能在权限、数据源、缓存、代理或后台任务。"},"3387":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-7","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq","content":"多数问题可先从工作台判断影响范围。能登录但菜单少，通常是权限问题；工作台空白或资源统计异常，可能是接口、权限或元数据问题；只有某个资源异常，则优先检查该资源的上游数据和权限。"},"3388":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-8","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"服务无法访问、初始密码、登录失败、端口和 HTTPS 问题。"},"3389":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-9","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"菜单不可见、资源不可见、角色授权和账号生命周期问题。"},"3390":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-10","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"数据源、数据集、图表、仪表盘、大屏和导出问题。"},"3391":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-11","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"单点登录、回调地址、Ingress、Pod 状态和集群部署问题。"},"3392":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-12","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#排查基本顺序","content":"这个顺序适合大多数问题。先确认现象和影响范围，是为了避免把单个用户的权限问题误判成系统故障；先记录时间，是为了在审计日志和应用日志中快速定位；最后用普通账号验证，是为了避免管理员账号验证通过但业务用户仍然不可用。"},"3393":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-13","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"信息"},"3394":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-14","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq