issions-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"当前账号是否登录到了正确环境。"},"3600":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"资源是否被移动、删除或取消发布。"},"3601":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"搜索关键字和资源类型筛选是否过窄。"},"3602":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"用普通测试账号复现，确认不是管理员视角误判。"},"3603":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"角色管理页用于维护用户职责分类。建议把角色按职责设计，而不是按个人设计。例如数据管理员、内容编辑者、业务查看者、安全审计员。后续人员变动时，只需调整用户归属，不需要重做权限模型。"},"3604":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"这通常是功能权限或资源操作权限不足。处理方法："},"3605":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"确认该用户是否具备资源编辑职责。"},"3606":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"检查角色是否有编辑功能权限。"},"3607":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"检查资源是否授权编辑而不只是查看。"},"3608":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"确认资源是否被其他用户锁定或正在编辑。"},"3609":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"使用普通测试账号验证按钮是否出现。"},"3610":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"v1.5.6 起，只读可见资源不会展示复制、移动、重命名和删除等管理入口。若用户需要复制或维护仪表盘、大屏，应授予资源管理权限，而不是只授予查看权限。"},"3611":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-52","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"公开分享链接属于只读访问链路。当前版本中，即使用户已经登录后台，访问 `/link/:uuid` 也会按分享页策略打开；后台工作台、数据源、数据集等管理路径仍按菜单权限和功能权限校验。排查权限问题时，不要把分享页能访问误判为后台资源权限已开放。"},"3612":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-53","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"管理员权限应按职责拆分，不建议所有管理员都拥有完整系统管理权限。"},"3613":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-54","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"建议拆分："},"3614":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-55","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"角色"},"3615":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-56","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"权限"},"3616":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-57","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"平台管理员"},"3617":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-58","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"用户、角色、系统参数、审计"},"3618":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-59","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"数据管理员"},"3619":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-60","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissio