事看不到数据大屏","content":"在权限管理中打开对应角色，确认菜单中包含“数据大屏”。"},"3641":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-82","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#示例运营同事看不到数据大屏","content":"确认对应大屏资源已经授权给该用户或角色。"},"3642":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-83","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#示例运营同事看不到数据大屏","content":"让用户退出重新登录，再访问数据大屏列表。"},"3643":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-84","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#示例运营同事看不到数据大屏","content":"如果仍不可见，检查资源是否被移动、删除或分享状态变化。"},"3644":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-85","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#示例用户能打开大屏但看不到数据","content":"这种情况通常不是菜单权限问题，而是数据权限、数据集过滤或数据源问题。先用管理员账号打开同一大屏确认是否有数据；管理员有数据而普通用户无数据时，再检查该用户的数据权限、行权限或图表过滤条件。"},"3645":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes","type":"page","content":"SSO 与 Kubernetes 问题","breadcrumbs":["技术文档","Crest","常见问题"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes"},"3646":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes-0","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes","content":"Crest 单点登录、回调地址、Ingress、Pod 状态和 Kubernetes 部署常见问题。"},"3647":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes-1","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes#sso-点击后跳转失败","content":"SSO 点击后跳转失败"},"3648":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes-2","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes#sso-回调后提示错误","content":"SSO 回调后提示错误"},"3649":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes-3","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes#sso-用户登录后无权限","content":"SSO 用户登录后无权限"},"3650":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/sso-kubernetes-4","page_id":"/docs/