ade-rollback-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"升级动作"},"4178":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.8"},"4179":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"备份后替换 `crest-service:v1.5.10` 和 `crest-web:v1.5.10`，不需要执行新增升级 SQL"},"4180":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.7"},"4181":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-52","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"先备份元数据库和运行目录，执行 `upgrade-sql/v1.5.7_to_v1.5.8.sql`，再替换 v1.5.10 前后端镜像"},"4182":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-53","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.6"},"4183":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-54","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"先执行 `upgrade-sql/v1.5.7_to_v1.5.8.sql`，再替换 v1.5.10 前后端镜像"},"4184":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-55","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.5"},"4185":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-56","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-ro