tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"发布页面前必须确认缓存可用且校验结果符合预期"},"5257":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-290","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#全量更新","content":"全量更新会重新拉取数据集范围内的数据。它适合数据量不大、字段结构经常变化，或没有可靠增量字段的数据集。"},"5258":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-291","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#全量更新","content":"操作步骤："},"5259":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-292","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#打开数据集编辑器","content":"进入“数据准备 → 数据集”，选择目标数据集并进入编辑。"},"5260":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-293","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#切换为缓存读取","content":"在左侧配置区把“读取方式”选为“缓存”。如果页面没有该选项，说明当前数据集或数据源不支持缓存。"},"5261":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-294","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#选择全量","content":"在“更新方式”中选择“全量”。全量方式不需要增量字段。"},"5262":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-295","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#设置更新频率","content":"需要人工控制时选“手动”；需要固定刷新时选“定时”，再设置分钟、小时或天级间隔。"},"5263":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-296","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#立即更新并验收","content":"点击“立即更新”，等待状态变为可用。然后切到数据预览，抽查行数、日期范围和核心指标。"},"5264":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-297","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#立即更新并验收","content":"全量更新配置简单，但数据量越大，执行时间和源库压力越高。正式环境建议避开业务高峰，例如设置在凌晨或数据仓库批处理完成之后。"},"5265":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-298","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#立即更新并验收","content":"点击“立即更新”时，系统会先保存当前数据集和缓存配置，再提交同步任务。修改字段、过滤条件、更新方式或定时配置后，不需要先单独保存一次再更新，但仍应在任务结束后检查预览结果。"},"5266":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-299","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"增量更新只拉取水位字段之后的新数据，并定期做全量校准。它适合订单、日志、需求流转、工单、流水等持续增长的数据。"},"5267":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-300","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"高级设置用于控制缓存任务的稳定性。增量字段决定同步起点；全量刷新间隔用于定期校准缓存；超时时间防止任务长期挂起；更新后校验用于发现源端和缓存端差异。"},"5268":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-301","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"高级设置不应随意跳过。增量字段选错时，常见问题不是任务失败，而是产生隐性漏数。比如需求状态会回写历史记录，只用创建时间做增量，就可能漏掉历史需求的状态变化；这种场景更适合用更新时间作为水位字段。"},"5269":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-302","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"切换增量字段或更新方式时，系统会清理旧水位。下一次同步会按新配置重新计算水位，不会继续沿用旧字段的同步位置。变更前建议记录原字段、变更原因和首次同步结果，方便回溯。"},"5270":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-303","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"增量更新要先选对水位字段。常见选择如下："},"5271":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-304","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"字段类型"},"5272":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-305","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"是否推荐"},"5273":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-306","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"说明"},"5274":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-307","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"自增主键"},"5275":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-308","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"推荐"},"5276":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-309","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"数据持续新增且不会回写历史记录时适合"},"5277":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-310","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"更新时间"},"5278":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-311","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"推荐"},"5279":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-312","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"适合会补录、修正状态或更新历史记录的数据"},"5280":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-313","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"创建时间"},"5281":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-314","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"谨慎"},"5282":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-315","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"只能覆盖新增数据，覆盖不了历史记录修改"},"5283":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-316","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"业务日期"},"5284":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-317","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"谨慎"},"5285":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-318","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","conten