cs/crest/user-guide/lineage-35","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage","content":"数据源是血缘的上游起点。这里能看到数据源类型、连接状态、表和字段。修改数据源连接、删除表、调整字段前，应该先到血缘里查看下游影响。"},"5833":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage-36","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage","content":"数据集是血缘中最关键的加工层。字段重命名、计算字段、分组字段、SQL 查询和缓存都可能改变下游图表结果。用户质疑指标来源时，通常要从图表追到数据集，再继续追到数据源字段。"},"5834":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage#血缘能解决什么问题","content":"问题"},"5835":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage-38","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage#血缘能解决什么问题","content":"血缘可提供的支持"},"5836":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage#血缘能解决什么问题","content":"表是否可以下线"},"5837":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage#血缘能解决什么问题","content":"查看表下游是否还有数据集、图表和页面"},"5838":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage#血缘能解决什么问题","content":"字段是否可以改名"},"5839":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage#血缘能解决什么问题","content":"查看字段是否被数据集和图表引用"},"5840":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage#血缘能解决什么问题","content":"数据集是否可以删除"},"5841":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/lineage#血缘能解决什么问题","content":"查看是否有图表、仪表盘或大屏使用"},"5842":{"id":"