n","content":"本章截图和字段名来自 Crest 内置演示数据，用来说明创建方法。实际项目中应替换为自己的数据集、字段、指标口径、页面标题和配色。示例不是固定模板，也不是唯一做法。"},"6372":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-99","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"列表页是所有大屏的管理入口。日常使用时，先在左侧选择文件夹，再在右侧打开预览、编辑、复制、移动或删除。"},"6373":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-100","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"区域"},"6374":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-101","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"作用"},"6375":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-102","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"使用建议"},"6376":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-103","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"左侧资源树"},"6377":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-104","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"管理文件夹和大屏资源"},"6378":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-105","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"按场景分组，例如“经营驾驶舱”“研发效能”“客户演示”"},"6379":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-106","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"大屏列表"},"6380":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-107","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"展示名称、创建人、更新时间和操作入口"},"6381":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-108","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"修改前先查看更新时间，避免误改他人正在维护的页面"},"6382":{"id":"/