后点击导出按钮，确认导出中心生成任务，下载后核对字段、表头和数据范围。"},"6516":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-243","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览并验证","content":"导出按钮不是简单截图下载。表格视图导出会结合当前筛选、联动、外部参数、Web 参数和钻取上下文生成 Excel。正式大屏中建议把导出按钮放在明细表附近，并用清晰文案说明导出范围。"},"6517":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-244","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#实战做出示例里的关键组件","content":"内置大屏里有几类组件适合复用：累积流图、阶段漏斗、投入产出矩阵、明细表、趋势图和时效排行。下面按“组件效果、示例字段、编辑器配置”说明。示例字段只用于演示配置思路，正式页面应替换为企业自己的需求、项目、人员、质量或经营字段。"},"6518":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-245","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"这张图用于看需求在不同阶段的堆积情况。面积越厚，说明该阶段积压越多；整体上升，说明需求池总量在增长；某个颜色持续变厚，通常代表该阶段成为瓶颈。"},"6519":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-246","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"演示示例配置："},"6520":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-247","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"配置项"},"6521":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-248","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"6522":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-249","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"图表类型"},"6523":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-250","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"累积流图"},"6524":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-251","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"数据集"},"6525":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-252","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"需求阶段每日快照类数据集"},"6526":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-253","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"X 轴"},"6527":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-254","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"日期 `stat_date`"},"6528":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-255","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"Y 轴"},"6529":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-256","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"需求数 `req_count`，汇总方式为求和"},"6530":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-257","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"堆叠/系列"},"6531":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-258","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"需求阶段 `stage_name`"},"6532":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-259","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"创建步骤："},"6533":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-260","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#准备数据集","content":"数据集至少要有日期、阶段、需求数三个字段。日期是一行快照的统计日期，阶段是需求当时所在阶段，需求数是该日期该阶段的数量。"},"6534":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-261","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#添加累积流图","content":"在大屏编辑器点击“图表”，选择累积流图。把组件放到页面主图区，宽度建议占页面一半以上，高度保持足够展示空间。"},"6535":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-262","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#绑定字段","content":"选择数据集后，把“日期”放入 X 轴，把“需求数”放入 Y 轴，把“需求阶段”放入系列或堆叠字段。"},"6536":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-263","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置排序","content":"阶段顺序建议按业务流转顺序排列，例如需求池、分析澄清、就绪待开发、开发中、代码评审、测试验证、待发布。"},"6537":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-264","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"打开平滑曲线和面积填充，保留图例。颜色按阶段固定，避免每次刷新后变化。X 轴日期可以按天或周展示，标签过密时减少显示。"},"6538":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-265","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"使用提醒：累积流图依赖“每日阶段快照”。如果只有当前状态，没有历史快照，就无法还原阶段变化，只能做当前阶段分布。"},"6539":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-266","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"可以按以下样例准备数据。字段名不必完全一样，但含义要对应："},"6540":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-267","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"统计日期"},"6541":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-268","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求阶段"},"6542":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-269","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求数"},"6543":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-270","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"2026-05-01"},"6544":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-271","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求池"},"6545":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-272","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"42"},"6546":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-273","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"2026-05-01"},"6547":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-274","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"开发中"},"6548":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-275","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"18"},"6549":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-276","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"2026-05-02"},"6550":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-277","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求池"},"6551":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-278","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"46"},"6552":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-279","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"2026-05-02"},"6553":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-280","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"开发中"},"6554":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-281","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"21"},"6555":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-282","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"如果数据源是一条需求一行，也可以先在 SQL 或数据集中按日期和阶段聚合成这种结构，再给大屏使用。"},"6556":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-283","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"这张图用于展示每个阶段的数量、平均耗时、P90 耗时和超期数量。它比普通漏斗更适合研发交付场景，因为用户能同时看到“量”和“耗时主要集中在哪些阶段”。"},"6557":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-284","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"演示示例配置："},"6558":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-285","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"配置项"},"6559":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-286","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"6560":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-287","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"图表类型"},"6561":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-288","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"阶段周期漏斗"},"6562":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-289","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"数据集"},"6563":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-290","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"阶段周期统计类数据集"},"6564":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-291","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"阶段字段"},"6565":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-292","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"阶段 `stage_name`"},"6566":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-293","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"数量字段"},"6567":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-294","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","ta