een#分段时效-p90","content":"需求阶段 `stage_name`"},"6683":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-410","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"指标"},"6684":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-411","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"平均耗时 `avg_days`、P90 耗时 `p90_days`"},"6685":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-412","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"创建时建议把 P90 和平均值使用不同颜色。若阶段名称较长，横向条形图比竖向柱状图更容易阅读。"},"6686":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-413","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"P90 的含义要在页面上说清楚。可以在图表标题或说明里写“P90 表示 90% 的需求在该天数内完成”。如果观众不熟悉统计指标，只写 P90 会影响理解。"},"6687":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-414","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"数据正确后，再做样式。大屏样式的目标是“远距离可读”，而非开启所有视觉效果。"},"6688":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-415","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"编辑器截图适合对照右侧样式面板。选中不同组件，右侧配置项会变化。调整样式时先统一标题、字号和单位，再处理颜色、边框、背景和动画。"},"6689":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-416","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"选中组件后，右侧会显示该组件的配置项。先调整位置、尺寸和层级，再调数据和样式。大屏制作中不要频繁手工拖出不同尺寸，建议同一行组件保持相同高度，相邻组件保持一致间距。"},"6690":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-417","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"样式调整顺序："},"6691":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-418","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"标题：先统一大屏标题、图表标题和指标标题的字号。"},"6