uide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"页面底部或版权信息是否符合企业规范。"},"8312":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-34","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"分享页面是否也展示正确。"},"8313":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-35","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"入口：系统管理 → 字体管理。"},"8314":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-36","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"字体管理页影响仪表盘、大屏和导出效果。上传字体后，不能说明所有页面会自动使用该字体；需要在对应仪表盘或大屏编辑器中选择并保存。对外项目还要确认字体授权范围。"},"8315":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"字体管理常用于数据大屏交付。上传字体前应确认授权范围，尤其是对外展示、商用项目和客户交付环境。"},"8316":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-38","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"字体上传后建议用一张正式大屏做验证，而不是只看字体列表是否出现。因为字体真正生效的位置在编辑器和渲染结果中，特别是中文标题、数字指标、导出图片和投屏环境。对外项目要避免使用没有授权的商业字体。"},"8317":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"操作流程："},"8318":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#准备字体","content":"确认字体文件来源、授权范围和格式。"},"8319":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#上传字体","content":"在字体管理页面上传字体文件，名称保持简洁可识别。"},"8320":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#应用到资源","content":"在仪表盘或大屏编辑器中选择字体，保存并预览。"},"8321":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#导出验证","content":"使用图片、PDF 或预览功能检查字体是否生效。"},"8322":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"场景"},"8323":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"建议"},"8324":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"客户交付"},"8325":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"统一 Logo、标题、字体和版权"},"8326":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"多环境部署"},"8327":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"测试、预发、生产保持配置差异可追踪"},"8328":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"字体过多"},"8329":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"清理未使用字体，避免编辑器选择混乱"},"8330":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-52","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"参数变更频繁"},"8331":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-53","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"建立配置变更审批和记录"},"8332":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-54","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"页面展示异常"},"8333":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-55","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"先排查站点配置、字体资源和浏览器缓存"},"8334":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-56","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"登录页截图是否符合项目形象。"},"8335":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-57","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"工作台名称和 Logo 是否正确。"},"8336":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-58","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"仪表盘和大屏是否使用统一字体。"},"8337":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-59","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"分享页面是否有正确品牌信息。"},"8338":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-60","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"导出文件是否能正确显示字体。"},"8339":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-61","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"交付验收建议保留截图：登录页、工作台、一个仪表盘预览、一个大屏预览、一个导出文件。这样后续客户或业务方反馈品牌展示问题时，可以快速对比变更前后效果。"},"8340":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-62","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"建议把站点配置变更写入交付清单，至少包含修改人、修改时间、旧值、新值和验收截图。这样后续升级、迁移或重装时，可以快速恢复一致的品牌展示。"},"8341":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"page","content":"用户与组织","breadcrumbs":["技术文档","Crest","管理员指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs"},"8342":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-0","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","content":"Crest 用户管理、组织管理、账号生命周期和账号安全操作说明。"},"8343":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-1","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#用户管理对象","content":"用户管理对象"},"8344":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-2","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#创建用户","content":"创建用户"},"8345":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-3","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#进入用户管理","content":"进入用户管理"},"8346":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-4","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#新建用户","content":"新建用户"},"8347":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-5","page_id":"/docs/c