_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","content":"入口：系统管理 → 用户管理。"},"8358":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-16","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","content":"用户管理页是管理员处理账号生命周期的主入口。图中通常可以看到组织树、用户列表、搜索区和操作按钮。日常操作时，先在组织树定位部门，再在用户列表中搜索账号；新增、禁用、重置密码、调整角色都应从这里开始。"},"8359":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-17","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#用户管理对象","content":"对象"},"8360":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-18","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#用户管理对象","content":"说明"},"8361":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-19","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#用户管理对象","content":"用户账号"},"8362":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-20","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#用户管理对象","content":"用户登录 Crest 的身份"},"8363":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-21","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#用户管理对象","content":"用户姓名"},"8364":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-22","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#用户管理对象","content":"页面展示、审计日志和协作识别"},"8365":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-23","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#用户管理对象","content":"邮箱 / 手机"},"8366":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-24","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#用户管理对象","content":"联系和账号识别信息"},"8367":{"id":"/docs/cr